  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Search path",
      "items": [
        "Opus 5.5 turns a question into filters + search text; cause-label chips (climate, women and girls)",
        "One query: SQL filters, 2,000 nearest on a half-precision HNSW index, keyword hits",
        "Sonnet 5.5 scores the top 40, 0–100 with a reason",
        "Analysis panel from the 200 closest; Export slide builds PNG / PPTX in the browser",
        "Org page: grants received (990-PF, Schedule I by funder type, federal awards) and given (Schedule I incl. not itemized)",
        "Research Buddy (Opus 5.5) cites 990 text and calls the research_answer tool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Research answers",
      "items": [
        "Regex screen, then the prompt-cached Sonnet 5.5 router writes a spec",
        "Fixed SQL on foundation_grants, charity_grants, federal_awards or 990 lines; never model-written SQL",
        "Premise check corrects false assumptions; trust note when a cause has no graded label",
        "Buddy, /api/v1/answer and MCP call the same engine",
        "Findings: miner writes verified patterns; Ask about this finding answers from that finding's data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Hosting + access",
      "items": [
        "MacBook: launchd service on :4000, public URL via Tailscale Funnel",
        "SITE_PASSWORD on every page; /api/v1 and /mcp need a Bearer key instead",
        "Keys: sha256 in api_keys, per-key rate limit, daily usage; no Claude calls except answer?q=",
        "Nightly pg_dump at 2:30 AM, newest 3 kept"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Data",
      "items": [
        "IRS: 1.8M orgs, SOI, 907,095 990 filings, 5.72M foundation grants, 3.41M Schedule I grants",
        "Schedule I flags DAF sponsors, community foundations, United Ways; missing XML recovered from GivingTuesday",
        "Census SAIPE + ACS 5-year, USAspending federal awards, SEC EDGAR company foundation flag",
        "Federal awards linked by UEI through the Federal Audit Clearinghouse crosswalk (load_fac_crosswalk.py, relink_federal.py)",
        "Cause labels: label_causes.py on the Claude subscription (claude -p); after_load.sh tops them up",
        "org_labels feed search chips, research answers, API/MCP and the Parquet snapshot",
        "Research layer: grant_cube, charity cube, grant-size histograms, rollups, cause_lookup"
      ]
    }
  ]
}